  "description": "After falling victim to a scam, Sammy takes a job at a real estate agency that promises a high salary. However, it turns out to be a suspicious firm that buys haunted houses cheaply, exorcises them, and resells them at full price. Furthermore, the boss hired her because he discovered she can see ghosts! If something feels off about your house, welcome to Happy Real Estate!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**        \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=855591), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14797048)",
